---
import ProcessStep from "./ProcessStep.astro";
---

<section id="process" style="text-align:center">
  <span class="section-tag">How we work</span>
  <h2 class="section-title" style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 8px;">A clear path from first brief to supported launch</h2>
  <p class="section-sub" style="margin:0 auto;">Simple stages, visible progress, and enough structure to keep every website, network, system, or design project on track.</p>
  <div class="process-steps">
    <ProcessStep num="01" title="Discover" description="We map your goals, current setup, users, and the business problem the project needs to solve." />
    <ProcessStep num="02" title="Plan" description="You get a clear scope, timeline, budget, and delivery plan before production starts." />
    <ProcessStep num="03" title="Build" description="We design, configure, develop, and test with regular check-ins so progress stays visible." />
    <ProcessStep num="04" title="Launch & Support" description="We deploy, hand over, train where needed, and stay available for improvements and maintenance." />
  </div>
</section>
